'''Crimson Blaze''' (Japanese: '''{{j|紅蓮ブレイズ}}''' ''Crimson Blaze'') is the seventh themed booster pack, and the thirteenth expansion overall, in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Crimson Blaze''' is the seventh themed booster pack released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. The expansion continues to introduce {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} into the game, with a focus on the [[Mega Evolution]]s of the [[first partner Pokémon]] trio of the [[Kanto]] [[region]]. It also features various characters from {{g|X and Y}}, such as [[Serena]] and [[Clemont]], as Trainer cards.

